# Plugin Behaviours

## Plugin Lifecycle

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin
@callback on_load(facade :: struct()) :: :ok | {:error, term()}
@callback on_ready(facade :: struct()) :: :ok | {:error, term()}
```

## ServiceTaskHandler

Unique by `implementation`. Handles Service Task dispatch by `implementation` attribute. Always asynchronous.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.ServiceTaskHandler
@callback handle_enter(flow_node, token, handler_context) ::
  {:async, String.t()} | {:error, term()}
```

## EventSink

Many allowed. Receives engine events.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.EventSink
@callback init(opts :: keyword()) :: {:ok, state} | {:error, term()}
@callback accepts?(event :: struct()) :: boolean()
@callback handle_event(event, state) :: {:ok, state} | :skip
@callback handle_shutdown(state) :: :ok
```

## PersistenceAdapter

Unique. Replaces or chains default persistence.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.PersistenceAdapter
@callback init(opts :: keyword()) :: {:ok, state} | {:error, term()}
@callback persist(changeset, state) :: {:ok, term()} | {:error, term()}
```

## RestApiExtension

Mounted under prefix.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.RestApiExtension
@callback router_module() :: module()
```

## MonitoringPanel

Many allowed. Admin page fragment.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.MonitoringPanel
@callback render(assigns :: map()) :: term()
@callback panel_title() :: String.t()
```

## TimerSource

Unique per type.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.TimerSource
@callback timer_type() :: atom()
@callback evaluate(definition :: String.t(), context :: map()) ::
  {:ok, DateTime.t()} | {:error, term()}
```

## DataStoreAdapter

Unique per store_id.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.DataStoreAdapter
@callback store_id() :: String.t()
@callback read(key :: String.t(), opts :: keyword()) :: {:ok, term()} | {:error, term()}
@callback write(key :: String.t(), value :: term(), opts :: keyword()) :: :ok | {:error, term()}
```

## NamedScript

Unique by script_key. Handles `evil:scriptRef` dispatch. Always synchronous.

```elixir
@behaviour EvilEngine.Plugin.NamedScript
@callback handle_enter(flow_node :: map(), payload :: map(), context :: map()) ::
  {:ok, map()} | {:error, term()}
```
